{"unit_id":"BuLongY__dsh-proxy#card-zh","repo":"BuLongY/dsh-proxy","commit":"c3669cd2e675acd156e10f6349739249cb9df81b","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-proxy 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的网络代理插件：它为宿主进程的原生 fetch 请求按目标主机添加 undici dispatcher，将普通请求经本地 HTTP/HTTPS 代理转发，并让配置的直连主机绕过代理。设置页可启停代理、修改主机和端口、维护直连名单，设置变更后即时应用。插件卸载时恢复原始 fetch。适合需要让 DSH 的模型调用、模型发现、插件市场或联网请求使用本机代理的用户；需要已有可用的 HTTP 代理服务，不需要额外 API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:82-103","src/index.ts:121-155","src/client.tsx:101-169"]}
{"unit_id":"BuLongY__dsh-proxy#card-en","repo":"BuLongY/dsh-proxy","commit":"c3669cd2e675acd156e10f6349739249cb9df81b","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-proxy routes DSH Web host fetch through a local HTTP proxy, with selected hosts bypassing it. Its settings page controls proxy and bypass hosts; changes apply immediately. Unloading restores fetch. A local proxy service is required; no API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:82-103","src/index.ts:121-155","src/client.tsx:101-169"]}
