{"unit_id":"BuLongY__dsh-proxy#feature-1","repo":"BuLongY/dsh-proxy","commit":"c3669cd2e675acd156e10f6349739249cb9df81b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-proxy 的功能「宿主请求代理」：为 DSH 宿主的原生 fetch 请求添加代理 dispatcher，使请求通过配置的 HTTP 代理发送。插件启用时自动生效。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:82-103","src/index.ts:121-141"]}
