{"unit_id":"BuLongY__dsh-proxy#caveat-1","repo":"BuLongY/dsh-proxy","commit":"c3669cd2e675acd156e10f6349739249cb9df81b","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-proxy 使用前须知：插件默认将非直连主机的宿主 fetch 请求发往本地 HTTP 代理（默认 127.0.0.1:7890）；请先启动并配置可用代理服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:21-27","src/index.ts:126-140"]}
